notes.notes:
Newspaper glitch fixed: You can't press E while looking at the newspapers;

Buffed Swampmonster: In the level where Swampmonster tries to get you, made him a bit faster, so you can't escape by just walking;

Added temporary error fixes in the gas station first levels: If you encounter a major bug, you get a screen to restart the level where you were in;

Added a new secret ending: In the level where you made a mistake (by choosing the wrong option with the customers) you can find a secret room.
